# ── H2S Field Scanner (mobile app) — configuration ─────────────────────
# Copy to `.env` in this directory. Never commit a real `.env`.

# Base URL of the FastAPI backend (software/backend).
#
# Leave it unset for local development: the app then defaults to
# http://localhost:8000, or — when served from a LAN address — to
# http://<same-host>:8000, which is what a phone on the same Wi-Fi needs.
#
# A phone CANNOT reach the laptop's "localhost", so when testing on a real
# device set this to the laptop's LAN IP (or change it in-app under Settings).
# VITE_API_BASE=http://192.168.1.5:8000
